sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent as AEGIS Forwarder Agent
    participant API as API Server (Express.js)
    participant DB as Database (PostgreSQL)
    participant Engine as Auto-Defense Engine
    participant Dash as React Dashboard
    participant TG as Telegram Bot

    Agent->>API: POST /api/ingest/* (Normalized Event)
    activate API
    API->>API: Validate API Key (X-AEGIS-Key)
    API->>DB: INSERT INTO security_events
    API->>DB: INSERT INTO alerts (if severity >= Medium)
    
    par Real-time Updates
        API-->>Dash: SSE: security_event (Broadcast)
    and Notifications
        API->>TG: Send Message (if severity >= High)
    end

    API->>Engine: Evaluate Event against Rules
    activate Engine
    Engine->>DB: SELECT matching rules
    Engine->>DB: INSERT INTO defense_commands (if threshold met)
    deactivate Engine

    API-->>Agent: 201 Created (Success)
    deactivate API

    Note over Agent,Dash: Real-time loop completed in < 3 seconds
